Package: losdos
Title: Level-of-Service Attribute Estimation Using dodgr with the Ordnance Survey Multimodal Routing Network
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Harry Samuel", family = "Roberts", "ts22hr@leeds.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-5443-0684"))
Description: Computes distance and time estimates by walk, bicycle and car for origin-destination pairs using the Ordnance Survey Multimodal Routing Network with slope-aware walk/bike models and car routing with average link speeds and turn restrictions.
